olver objects.\n- Froze identity expressions, verification states and transitions, staging gates, field-level equivalence, second-read triggers, shared-error audit, one-question short-context, maker concurrency 1, checkpoint/resume, shard custody, external namespaces, and deterministic reconstruction.\n- Reconciled immutable historical populations while requiring production-contract revalidation before staging reuse.\n- Added a complete sequential paper-level batch partition.\n\n## Inventory and conservation\n\nA fresh recursive scan found 929 PDFs in the source roots: 919 QP/MS objects and 10 explicitly out-of-scope grade-threshold PDFs.\n\n- `eligible=864`\n- `missing_qp=0`\n- `missing_ms=0`\n- `corrupt=0`\n- `duplicate=1`\n- `identity_ambiguous=0`\n- `formally_excluded=54`\n- discovered conservation: `919 = 864 + 0 + 0 + 0 + 1 + 0 + 54`\n- canonical expected slots: `918`; missing expected QP/MS counterparts: `0/0`\n- paired canonical papers: `459 = 432 eligible Papers 1-6 + 27 formally excluded historical Paper 7 papers`\n\nThe older 891-document observation is explicitly reconciled: it was 432 QP + 459 MS before acquisition of 27 Paper 7 QPs. Exact-main authority now proves 459 QP + 459 MS with paths, bytes, SHA-256, and page counts.\n\nEligible paper count is 432. Estimated eligible question count is 3,530 from unique normalized historical registry rows covering all 432 eligible papers. Numerical uncertainty remains unquantified until complete source page-chain production verification; this is not presented as a source-verified question total.\n\nProduction verification counts in this freeze child are `verified=0`, `conflict=0`, `unresolved=0`.\n\n## Frozen sequential batches\n\n| Batch | Papers | Estimated questions | First to last canonical paper |\n|---|---:|---:|---|\n| 001 | 27 | 227 | `9709_m16_qp_12` to `9709_w16_qp_13` |\n| 002 | 27 | 215 | `9709_w16_qp_21` to `9709_s17_qp_23` |\n| 003 | 27 | 215 | `9709_s17_qp_31` to `9709_w17_qp_53` |\n| 004 | 27 | 217 | `9709_w17_qp_61` to `9709_s18_qp_63` |\n| 005 | 27 | 227 | `9709_w18_qp_11` to `9709_s19_qp_13` |\n| 006 | 27 | 218 | `9709_s19_qp_21` to `9709_w19_qp_43` |\n| 007 | 27 | 218 | `9709_w19_qp_51` to `9709_s20_qp_53` |\n| 008 | 27 | 217 | `9709_s20_qp_61` to `9709_m21_qp_62` |\n| 009 | 27 | 234 | `9709_s21_qp_11` to `9709_w21_qp_33` |\n| 010 | 27 | 217 | `9709_w21_qp_41` to `9709_s22_qp_43` |\n| 011 | 27 | 219 | `9709_s22_qp_51` to `9709_m23_qp_32` |\n| 012 | 27 | 223 | `9709_m23_qp_42` to `9709_w23_qp_23` |\n| 013 | 27 | 228 | `9709_w23_qp_31` to `9709_s24_qp_33` |\n| 014 | 27 | 210 | `9709_s24_qp_41` to `9709_w24_qp_63` |\n| 015 | 27 | 224 | `9709_m25_qp_12` to `9709_s25_qp_61` |\n| 016 | 27 | 221 | `9709_s25_qp_62` to `9709_w25_qp_65` |\n\nThe machine-readable plan contains every paper ID and proves exact once-only coverage.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `npm run 9709:full-corpus-freeze:build` — PASS, 22/22 validator checks.\n- `npm run 9709:full-corpus-freeze:test` — PASS on Node 22 and Node 20, 23/23 tests each.\n- `npm run 9709:full-corpus-freeze:check` — PASS, byte-identical deterministic regeneration.\n- `node --test scripts/storage-architecture/__tests__/9709-source-completeness.test.mjs` — PASS, 18/18 tests.\n- `git diff --check` — PASS.\n- `node --check` for generator and tests — PASS.\n\nNo local, external, or paid VLM call was made. No semantic, KG, canonical, production, public, downstream, Supabase, Storage, Vector, or runtime write was made. Historical artifacts were read and hash-bound only, never rewritten.\n\n## Review gate\n\nPlease perform a separate read-only independent review bound to exact head `5964ca75b42d6ff43785217f4544dbef99e95fdf`. Merge remains blocked until exact-head PASS, actionable-thread resolution, and all deterministic data-integrity gates remain passing.","created_at":"2026-07-21T16:40:50Z","updated_at":"2026-07-21T18:27:14Z","closed_at":"2026-07-21T18:22:56Z","merged_at":"2026-07-21T18:22:56Z","merge_commit_sha":"f6c8e004baae2607a